 "WorldChampionVR", "WorldBoxingChampionVR"], "long_description": "Step into the ring and experience the excitement of World Boxing Champion VR, an immersive virtual reality boxing experience designed for players who love intense fights and competitive action.\n\nIn World Boxing Champion VR, train your boxing skills, improve your punches, and challenge different opponents as you work your way toward becoming a champion.\n\nWorld Boxing Champion VR puts you directly inside the boxing arena, where timing, movement, and accurate punches are the keys to victory.\n\nGet ready for exciting matches in World Boxing Champion VR and test your skills against challenging fighters.\n\nWith World Boxing Champion VR, every match gives you an opportunity to improve your technique, reaction time, and fighting strategy.\n\nEnter the arena, raise your gloves, and fight like a true champion in World Boxing Champion VR.\n\nWhether you enjoy competitive boxing or simply want an exciting VR fighting experience, World Boxing Champion VR delivers an engaging experience inside the ring.\n\nKeep fighting, improve your skills, defeat your opponents, and continue your journey in World Boxing Champion VR.\n\nAre you ready to prove yourself and become the ultimate champion? Step into World Boxing Champion VR and start your boxing journey today.", "short_description": "Step into the ring, master powerful punches, face challenging opponents, and fight your way to the top in World Boxing Champion VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lightspeedstudio/home/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Light Speed Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/lightspeedstudio/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "27765422860006